---
import BaseLayout from '~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { BRAND } from '~/lib/site';

const path = '/thank-you/';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Request Received | The Poly Mailers"
  description="Your request has reached us. Here is what happens next and how to reach a person in the meantime."
  path={path}
  noindex
>
  <article class="wrap ty">
    <div class="ty-inner">
      <div class="ty-mark" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 32 32">
          <path
            d="M6 16.5 13 23.5 26 9.5"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="3"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <h1>Your request has reached us</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        A person will read it and reply by email to the address you gave us. If
        you attached artwork, it came through with the enquiry.
      </p>

      <section class="ty-next">
        <h2>What happens next</h2>
        <ol>
          <li>
            <strong>We read the brief</strong>
            <span>And come back with questions if anything is unclear, rather than guessing.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>We confirm a specification</strong>
            <span>Size, film weight, closure, colour, coverage and quantity, all in writing.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>You receive a price and a schedule</strong>
            <span>With a stated validity period, so it can be compared properly.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Nothing is scheduled until you say so</strong>
            <span>And for printed work, not until you have approved a proof.</span>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section class="ty-meanwhile">
        <h2>In the meantime</h2>
        <ul role="list">
          <li>
            <a href="/resources/custom-mailer-ordering-checklist/">
              The ordering checklist
            </a>
            <span>Eleven decisions that make a quotation accurate first time.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/size-guide/">Choosing a size</a>
            <span>The method, if the size question is still open.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/blog/">Articles</a>
            <span>Longer reads on cushioning, colour, artwork and materials.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="ty-contact">
        <h2>If it is urgent</h2>
        <p>
          Email <a href={`mailto:${BRAND.email}`}>{BRAND.email}</a> or call
          <a href={BRAND.phoneHref}>{BRAND.phoneDisplay}</a>. Mention that you
          have already sent a request so we can find it.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .ty { padding-block: var(--sp-2xl) var(--sp-2xl); }

  .ty-inner { max-width: 42rem; }

  .ty-mark {
    inline-size: 58px;
    block-size: 58px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--success-100);
    color: var(--success-600);
    margin-block-end: var(--sp-m);
  }

  .ty h1 { margin-block-end: 0.8rem; max-width: 16ch; }
  .ty .lede { font-size: var(--step-1); max-width: 48ch; }

  .ty-next,
  .ty-meanwhile,
  .ty-contact { margin-block-start: var(--sp-xl); }

  .ty h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.11em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--fg-subtle);
    margin-block-end: var(--sp-s);
  }

  .ty-next ol {
    counter-reset: s;
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.9rem;
  }

  .ty-next li {
    counter-increment: s;
    position: relative;
    padding-inline-start: 2.2rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.12rem;
  }

  .ty-next li::before {
    content: counter(s);
    position: absolute;
    inset-inline-start: 0;
    inset-block-start: 0.05rem;
    inline-size: 1.6rem;
    block-size: 1.6rem;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    color: var(--accent-hover);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .ty-next strong { font-size: 0.98rem; font-weight: 650; }
  .ty-next span { color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; }

  .ty-meanwhile ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.7rem;
  }

  .ty-meanwhile li { display: grid; gap: 0.1rem; }
  .ty-meanwhile a { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.98rem; }
  .ty-meanwhile span { color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: 0.88rem; }

  .ty-contact p { color: var(--fg-muted); }
  .ty-contact a { color: var(--accent); }
</style>
